Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:08.94,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,商业公会的委托?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:12.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,最近港都佛里梅尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:15.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,商船货物屡次被盗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:17.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,委托内容是调查这个事件
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:19.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,可以的话 也希望能抓到犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:21.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,及找到被偷的货物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:25.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,港都啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:27.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,海边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:41.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:45.65,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我接受这份委托
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:52.49,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:56.98,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不能来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:59.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我有很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:04.50,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,要我离开密涅瓦多日会有困难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.91,0:01:08.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.41,0:01:10.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:12.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没事先确认赛西莉亚的行程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:13.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是我的错啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:17.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,绑在妳腰上的东西是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:18.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,武器
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:22.35,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那该不会是妳的羽毛?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:23.85,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:26.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:28.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不要说些会让人误会的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:29.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:32.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,妳今天还满坦率的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:34.24,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:40.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福 妳怎么在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:44.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:51.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那 那个发饰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:58.27,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,往佛里梅尔 要出发啰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.17,0:02:00.37,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:03.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么幸福也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:04.68,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们不是去玩耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:08.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福也能成为我们的战力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.65,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,她的魔法还满厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:13.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:16.40,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我连这件事都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:20.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,因为你们才认识不久 不知道很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:23.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,之后多了解她就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:25.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:37.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福的旁边在那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:56.28,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,《身为魔族的我 想向勇者小队的可爱女孩告白》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:11.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,终于到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:14.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我先去委托人那里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:16.69,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你们就帮忙去打听一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:18.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:22.03,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那就拜托啰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:25.49,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,机会难得 就让你们两人单独相处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:31.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,情报
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:35.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,小姑娘 有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:36.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,委托
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,委托? 什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:45.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们是为受到商业公会的委托
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:49.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,想询问关于船只发生窃盗的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:52.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请问您知道犯人可能是谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:55.23,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,知道的话 就不用这么辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:58.90,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就算有人看守 货物仍在不知不觉中被偷了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:01.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,无法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:02.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:04.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,上级长官们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:07.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,甚至把我们这些船员当犯人看待
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:08.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,冤枉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:09.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:12.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,海上男儿才不偷东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,调查 交给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.81,0:05:16.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你们愿意相信我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:18.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:21.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,海上男儿不会说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:22.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,想问什么就问吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,大伙儿 过来集合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:32.37,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那个事件吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:34.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们是冤枉的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.51,0:05:35.94,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,小姑娘 要吃糖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:41.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,聚集这么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:46.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,辛苦了 怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:50.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,完全没有偷货物犯人的目击情报
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:54.52,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,每艘船都有人巡逻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但都没有人有事件发生当下的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:58.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:00.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊 很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,如果船员们是犯人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:05.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,至少会说些更象样的谎话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:08.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,看来 犯人另有他人?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:10.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,有几位船员们说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:14.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,记忆中断前 曾听到美妙的歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:15.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,歌声?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:17.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我想这件事恐怕和魔族有关
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,而且大概是人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:21.27,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我倒想见识一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:30.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福 听说有人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:31.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:35.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,果然是人鱼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:37.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,马沙 完蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:40.08,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们全部都会被吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:43.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你们是冒险家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:45.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,帮我们击退人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:49.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:49.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,{\an8}拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:51.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,人鱼就这么可怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:53.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:56.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,人鱼会害船只遇难
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,有不少船员被夺走性命耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:02.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这附近的海域原本是很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:05.69,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,恐怖到害人不敢搭船
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:11.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我是克拉利涅斯王国 骑士团团长渡鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:15.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,守护人民是我等骑士的义务
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我一定会打倒人鱼的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是勇者团队的骑士团团长大人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.41,0:07:22.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:25.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请团长大人打倒魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:27.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:33.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,对人类来说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:37.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,魔族 魔物都是恐怖的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:39.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,家里蹲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,干嘛突然这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:43.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,事实
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:46.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,魔王军 侵略人类
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:48.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:50.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,只是不小心忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:52.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.52,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,事情办完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.70,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,补充完纸笔了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:00.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.22,0:08:03.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:12.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好甜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:18.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是你们之间的氛围甜死了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:21.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树 有个人说他看过人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:25.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,刚才我在买东西 有位男性跟我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:32.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请问你是骑士团团长吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:34.24,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,(什么事)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:36.74,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是 是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:42.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那些船员在离郊外海湾处 发现被藏起来的货物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:44.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:46.75,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,人鱼也在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不觉得那个人有点奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:53.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,可是还是必须去确认一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:55.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福妳留下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:57.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:59.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,和魔族战斗很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:02.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,为何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.97,0:09:05.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,之前 魔王军在某个村子作恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.73,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:20.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们没能 保护好很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:24.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我是骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:27.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,守护人民是我等骑士的义务
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:29.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我一定会打倒人鱼的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:31.63,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,所以放心等我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:35.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,坚持拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:38.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:39.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:41.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,放心啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:44.39,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那家伙比外表强上百倍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.76,0:09:46.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:50.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.01,0:09:53.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,木箱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:58.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,都和被偷的货物内容一致
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:01.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,海
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:04.20,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,要在这里停船太小了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:06.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,渡鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:07.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:25.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,摀住耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:35.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,一个不注意就差点睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:38.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:39.78,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,妳要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:53.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福的歌声 消除掉人鱼的歌声吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:54.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:02.55,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:17.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我死无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:19.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:22.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我的同伴被人类抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,她没做任何坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:28.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,求求你们一定要救她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.66,0:11:29.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:32.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我不会被魔族的话语所迷惑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.87,0:11:40.88,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不满
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:00.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:06.74,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,幸福 妳让开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.24,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:11.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么包庇魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:13.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:18.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,渡鸦 你先把剑放下好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:21.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树你也要帮魔族吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:22.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:25.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,如果魔族攻击人类的话 当然要打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:30.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我当然不会原谅 伤害我或我同伴的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.61,0:12:31.73,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:34.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,因为感觉好像有什么原因
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:36.98,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,先听听看她的话也不迟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:40.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:55.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:02.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这样啊 妳变强了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:04.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请 请问
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:07.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:12.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,有什么原因 妳说来听听吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:16.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你们愿意相信我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.61,0:13:18.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,相信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:20.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:21.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不妙啊 不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:31.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好 先自我介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:35.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我是冒险家阳树 请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:38.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,撞到头了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:40.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 我很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:43.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我本来想转换一下气氛的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:45.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这个没礼貌的家伙是幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:49.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那位表情严肃的人是渡鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:53.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那个 我是希凯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:57.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,希凯 妳为什么想催眠我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,有人要我这么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:06.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们平常会远离人类过生活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:07.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:15.37,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我和朋友米莎琪正在游玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:19.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,突然被卷入暴风雨中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:24.05,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,回过神来 我们就被人类抓起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:28.05,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,如果要保妳同伴的命 就乖乖听话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:33.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,之后我就听人类的指示唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,让在船上的人睡着
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:41.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,感觉她不像在说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.52,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树 不能被外表骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:46.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不能 相信?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:50.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么能相信魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:15:02.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那么 希望你相信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:03.84,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,相信她的我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:07.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:11.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:14.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就以那条人鱼说的话为基础
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:16.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,重新调查
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:22.35,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,空的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:26.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是虚有其表的假货
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:31.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,故意提供情报 把要抓盗贼的人引来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,然后用人鱼的歌声催眠 并杀人封口
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:36.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就是这么回事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:39.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们差点就被杀了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:43.13,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,如果这是魔族做的 未免也绕太大一圈了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:47.08,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,希凯 妳知道他们的根据地在哪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:51.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,移动的时候 他们遮住了我的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.71,0:15:53.14,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,所以我不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:55.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:57.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,如果我推测得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:16:00.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,犯人们差不多要来这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:01.64,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,让他们说出真相吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:04.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,交给我来确认
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:09.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没想到会被骑士团盯上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:13.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,差不多该更换据点了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:20.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,骑士团团长 您没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.16,0:16:22.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们很担心 所以来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:25.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你们就是犯人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:28.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你那是什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.62,0:16:31.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,声音太好笑了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:33.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,看来不只是我 连你们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:39.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,都不如那条为朋友担心的人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我不会杀了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.01,0:16:44.23,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但我要让你们接受法律的制裁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:46.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,该死的人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:49.73,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,之后得要好好地处罚她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:51.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,全部都给我上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:56.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.59,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:25.10,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:30.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,一群胆敢利用柔弱人鱼的坏蛋们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:31.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你们的故事将划上休止符
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:33.03,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:46.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,一起战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:56.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请 请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:18:00.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们是被人鱼操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:05.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,人鱼的朋友在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:16.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那 应该就是希凯的朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:19.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,居然被当成货物关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:43.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,妳是叫做米莎琪的人鱼对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:47.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我的尾巴变成双腿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:49.44,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但出不了力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.51,0:18:51.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,变态
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.22,0:18:52.52,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我没看啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:54.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,报告
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:56.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 妳想跟谁报告
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:02.95,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,米莎琪 我好担心妳喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,乖喔乖喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:08.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我才不会这么容易被打倒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:11.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀 得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:12.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,超感谢你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:13.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好轻浮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:19.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,真的很谢谢你们救了米莎琪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:21.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你们是我们的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:24.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我也非常感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:30.19,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,为了谢谢你们 我来唱首歌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:31.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:35.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,放心 没有催眠效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.71,0:19:39.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,主题是 "感谢救命之恩"之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好白话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:34.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:43.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:46.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这是什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好 我嗨起来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.81,0:20:57.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:08.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:10.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,真的很谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:13.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,别再被坏人抓走啰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:21.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我差点就要杀了无罪的妳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:24.34,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,再 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:36.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,再见 有缘再相逢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:46.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:50.27,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我先道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:51.49,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,妳说什
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,妳 干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.16,0:22:18.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 你们刚才做了什么
